#{[17592186479938 #edb/ref 1168 "generate/scratch/17592186119772.py" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186479938 #edb/ref 1169 #uuid "d2395edc-bbe3-50b5-b81d-08999f774447" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186487471 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186487474 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186487471 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186487471 #edb/ref 1071 "How can we best describe the following matrix? \n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}-6 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -3\\end{bmatrix}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186487471 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "25b4a25d-b604-50d3-a613-7e42cd7fe17c" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186487471 #edb/ref 1074 "Notice that $A$ is a matrix for which all entries above and below the diagonal are $0$'s:\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}-6 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -3\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nTherefore, it is a diagonal matrix." #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186487475 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186487481 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186487475 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186487475 #edb/ref 1071 "How can we best describe the following matrix? \n\n$$\nC=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186487475 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "920f5203-81a8-5e78-b479-49da70a1546b" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186487475 #edb/ref 1074 "Notice that $C$ is a matrix for which all entries above and below the diagonal are $0$'s:\n\n$$\nC=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nTherefore, it is a diagonal matrix." #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186487484 #edb/ref 1168 "generate/scratch/17592186119771.py" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186487484 #edb/ref 1169 #uuid "e05fa25f-72fd-5d29-936a-59f9a850ed50" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186488404 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186488396 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186488404 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186488402 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186488404 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186488403 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186488404 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186488404 #edb/ref 1071 "Consider the matrix \n$B=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 6 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -7 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & -2\\end{bmatrix}.$\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $B$ is upper triangular\n- **II.** $B$ is lower triangular\n- **III.** $B-{B}^{T}$ is upper triangular" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186488404 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "ac6bf26c-daf9-5149-b82c-ecff54a2e1d7" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186488404 #edb/ref 1074 "Let's analyze each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is true, since all the entries below the main diagonal equal to zero:\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 6 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -7 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- Statement II is false, since $B$ has non-zero entries above the main diagonal:\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 6 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -7 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- Statement III is false, since the result of $B-{B}^{T}$ has non-zero entries below the main diagonal:\n\n$$\nB-{B}^{T}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 6 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -6 & 0 & -7 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 7 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -6 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only\"." #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186488405 #edb/ref 1168 "generate/scratch/17592186119784.py" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186488405 #edb/ref 1169 #uuid "2ead4764-174c-5d84-bcf9-29e935ade0e4" #edb/ref 17592186045443]}
